type: software
title: "GrowthParameterEstimation.jl"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for fitting growth ODE models to time-series data, with
  utilities for model comparison, staged and joint fitting across related
  datasets, uncertainty quantification, and practical and structural
  identifiability analysis.
